Third-party data and provenance
================================

ibus-table-zhengma is a compilation of ZhengMa input-method data. The
project's build scripts and original table contributions are licensed under
GPL-3.0-or-later (see COPYING). The following portions have their own
provenance as recorded in the table header and README:

* GB18030 character encodings: derived from ZhengMa-6.6. Copyright belongs
  to ZhongYi Inc. (中易公司).

* CJK-A goucima: added by Yu Yuwei and released under GPL-3.0-or-later.

* CJK-B and CJK-C character encodings: contributed by 一呜惊人
  <ranglming@126.com>.

* Five-code ZhengMa phrase scheme: suggested by "郑码大师" on
  www.zmfans.cn/bbs.

* docs/ZiGenBiao.pdf: the ZhengMa root chart that, according to the README,
  was made available by ZhongYi on the ZhengMa fans forum.

